usb: cdns3: propagate PHY mode failures and unwind activation

Return PHY mode errors after dropping the requested bus and clearing
both PHY modes. Check activation results before allocating host or
gadget state; failed starts do not receive a role stop callback. Log
mode cleanup failures while preserving the activation errno. Retry an
unchanged role request when its previous activation did not become
active.

